msgstr "测验章节级别"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:907
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Which TOC level counts as a 'chapter' for end-of-chapter quizzes. A fixed level falls back to the deepest level the book actually has. 'Auto-detect' picks the deepest level whose chapters are at least the minimum length below. 'All TOC headings' follows KOReader's TOC tick settings. Short or skimmed chapters are skipped by the length setting below."
msgstr "哪个目录级别被视为章节结束测验的\"章节\"。固定级别会回退到书籍实际拥有的最深级别。\"自动检测\"会选取章节长度不低于下方最短长度设定的最深级别。\"所有目录标题\"遵循 KOReader 的目录刻度设置。过短或快速翻阅的章节会根据下方长度设置被跳过。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:913
#, fuzzy
msgid "Minimum Chapter Length (pages)"
msgstr "最短章节长度（页数）"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:920
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Skip the chapter-end quiz for chapters shorter than this many pages (0 = no minimum). Also sets the threshold 'Auto-detect' uses to pick the chapter level. Can be overridden per book in Book Settings."
msgstr "跳过短于此页数的章节结束测验（0 = 无最低限制）。同时设定\"自动检测\"用于选取章节级别的阈值。可在书籍设置中针对单本书籍进行覆盖。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:926
#, fuzzy
msgid "Minimum Reading Time (minutes)"
msgstr "最短阅读时间（分钟）"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:933
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Skip the chapter-end quiz unless you spent at least this many minutes reading the chapter (0 = no minimum). Catches flipping quickly through a long chapter. Uses KOReader's reading statistics; if those are unavailable the quiz is still offered. Can be overridden per book in Book Settings."
msgstr "跳过章节末测验，除非您在该章节上至少花费了这么多分钟阅读（0 = 无最低要求）。可检测快速翻阅长章节的情况。使用 KOReader 的阅读统计数据；如果统计数据不可用，测验仍会提供。可在书籍设置中按书籍覆盖此设置。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:939
#, fuzzy
msgid "Question Count"
msgstr "题目数量"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:946
#, fuzzy
msgid "Total number of questions to generate per quiz."
msgstr "每次测验生成的题目总数。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:951
#, fuzzy
msgid "Difficulty"
msgstr "难度"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:959
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Easy: straightforward recall. Medium: comprehension and application. Hard: analysis and synthesis."
msgstr "简单：直接回忆。中等：理解与应用。困难：分析与综合。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:964
#, fuzzy
msgid "Include Multiple Choice"
msgstr "包含多选题"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:971
#, fuzzy
msgid "Include Short Answer"
msgstr "包含简答题"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:978
#, fuzzy
msgid "Include Discussion"
msgstr "包含讨论题"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:994
#, fuzzy
msgid "Automatic X-Ray (all books)"
msgstr "自动X-Ray（所有图书）"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:997
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Keep the X-Rays you started up to date as you read (flowing formats like EPUB only): checkpoints at chapter-sized steps, always keeping the next checkpoint ready ahead of you; reaching it installs it instantly and the one after starts building. Books with no X-Ray are left alone: start one from the X-Ray popup with \"In checkpoints, as I read (automatic)\", or switch a book to Automatic individually (X-Ray popup or Book Settings → X-Ray → Automatic X-Ray), which works even with this off; a per-book Off always wins.\n"
"\n"
"Spend guards: a cooldown before retrying a step that was declined, failed or cancelled, WiFi only, and the book's text allowed for the book, or a trusted provider (a book on Ask is asked once); background runs extract book text and use API tokens without a per-request tap. Leave off if every request should be explicit."
msgstr ""
"在您阅读时,让您已启动的 X-Ray 保持最新(仅限 EPUB 等流式格式):以章节大小为步长设置检查点,并始终在您前方准备好下一个检查点;读到该检查点时会立即安装,随后开始构建再下一个。没有 X-Ray 的书籍不受影响:可在 X-Ray 弹窗中选择\"分检查点,随阅读进行(自动)\"来启动一个,或单独将某本书切换为自动(X-Ray 弹窗或书籍设置 → X-Ray → 自动 X-Ray),即使此项关闭也有效;单本书的\"关闭\"始终优先。\n"
"\n"
"花费保护:在重试被拒绝、失败或取消的步骤前设有冷却时间,仅限 WiFi,且需要该书的文本已被允许使用,或使用受信任的提供商(设为\"询问\"的书籍会询问一次);后台运行会提取书籍文本并消耗 API 令牌,无需逐次请求确认。如果希望每次请求都明确确认,请保持关闭。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1023
#, fuzzy
msgid "Cooldown (minutes)"
msgstr "冷却时间（分钟）"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1030
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Minimum wait before retrying an automatic checkpoint after one was declined, failed or cancelled (0 = no cooldown). A completed build does not wait."
msgstr "自动检查点被拒绝、失败或取消后，重试前的最短等待时间（0 表示无冷却时间）。已完成的构建无需等待。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1036
#, fuzzy
msgid "Notify on Background Activity"
msgstr "后台活动通知"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1039
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Show a brief notification when a background X-Ray update or create starts and completes, and when a checkpoint is silently swapped in. Off = fully silent (the X-Ray popup always shows the current coverage)."
msgstr "在后台X-Ray更新或创建开始及完成时，以及检查点被静默替换时，显示简短通知。关闭=完全静默（X-Ray弹窗始终显示当前覆盖范围）。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1045
#, fuzzy
msgid "Checkpoints at Chapter Ends"
msgstr "检查点设于章节末尾"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1048
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When building X-Ray checkpoints, place each checkpoint at the nearest chapter end (within a few percent) instead of an exact percentage; checkpoints then read as \"up to the end of a chapter\", and the versions list shows the chapter names. Needs a table of contents. Checkpoint spacing itself adapts to book length: about every 10% of a normal-length book, larger steps for short ones."
msgstr "在构建X-Ray检查点时，将每个检查点放置在最近的章节末尾（误差在几个百分点内），而非精确的百分比位置；这样检查点会显示为\"到某章节末尾\"，版本列表也会显示章节名称。需要目录信息。检查点间距本身会根据图书长度自适应：正常长度图书大约每10%设一个，短篇则步长更大。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1053
#, fuzzy
msgid "Preset for New X-Rays"
msgstr "新 X-Ray 的预设"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1056
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"One tap for the three settings below it: what a new X-Ray tracks, whether it keeps the status block (\"Where things stand\"), and how much each entry carries. Characters only is the cheapest (the cast, no status block); Reference is the default (people, places, ideas and terms); Everything adds the story arc; Light companion and Deep study change the depth as well. Each setting can still be changed on its own; the preset then reads Custom. A book can pick its own preset in Book Settings and a group in its Group Settings. Applies when an X-Ray is created or rebuilt."
msgstr "一键设置下方三项:新 X-Ray 跟踪的内容、是否保留状态块(\"目前进展\"),以及每个条目包含的详细程度。\"仅角色\"最省(仅人物表,无状态块);\"参考\"为默认值(人物、地点、概念和术语);\"全部\"会加入故事线;\"轻度伴读\"和\"深度学习\"还会改变详细程度。每项设置仍可单独更改;此时预设会显示为\"自定义\"。书籍可在书籍设置中选择自己的预设,书组可在其组设置中选择。在创建或重建 X-Ray 时生效。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1061
#, fuzzy
msgid "Categories for New X-Rays"
msgstr "新X-Ray的分类"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1064
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Which category groups a new X-Ray tracks by default. Reference (everything except the timeline) unless changed here; All categories adds the timeline or argument development, Characters only is the lightest. The last checkbox, \"Where things stand\", is the status block (current state, or the conclusion of a whole-book X-Ray): every update rewrites it, so an X-Ray without it has shorter updates. Applies when an X-Ray is created or rebuilt; individual books can pick their own categories in Book Settings."
msgstr "新 X-Ray 默认跟踪的类别组。除非在此更改,否则为\"参考\"(除时间线外的所有内容);\"所有类别\"会加入时间线或论点发展,\"仅角色\"最轻量。最后一个复选框\"目前进展\"是状态块(当前状态,或整本书 X-Ray 的结论):每次更新都会重写它,因此没有它的 X-Ray 更新更短。在创建或重建 X-Ray 时生效;单本书可在书籍设置中选择自己的类别。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1069
#, fuzzy
msgid "Depth of New X-Rays"
msgstr "新建 X-Ray 的深度"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1072
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"How much each X-Ray entry carries by default. Light: one line per entry, only recurring figures and turning points, about half the cost. Standard: a few sentences per entry, everything the reader meets. Deep: longer entries, every figure and development, richer connections. Applies when an X-Ray is created or rebuilt; checkpoints and updates keep the depth the X-Ray was started with. Individual books can pick their own depth in Book Settings."
msgstr "X-Ray条目默认携带的信息量。简略：每条一行，仅列出反复出现的人物和关键转折，成本约为一半。标准：每条几句话，涵盖读者遇到的一切。深入：条目更长，收录所有人物和情节发展，关联更丰富。此设置在创建或重建X-Ray时生效；检查点和更新会保持X-Ray启动时所用的深度。各本书可在书籍设置中选择自己的深度。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1077
#, fuzzy
msgid "Type of New X-Rays"
msgstr "新 X-Ray 的类型"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1080
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Whether a new X-Ray uses the fiction schema (characters, places, story), the nonfiction one (people, concepts, argument) or the academic one (concepts, methods, findings, cited works). Auto, the default, lets the AI decide from the work. Applies when an X-Ray is created or rebuilt; updates keep the X-Ray's own type. Individual books can pick their own type in Book Settings, which is where a book whose X-Ray came out as the wrong type is fixed."
msgstr "新的 X-Ray 使用虚构模板（人物、地点、故事）、非虚构模板（人物、概念、论点），还是学术模板（概念、方法、研究发现、引用文献）。默认的“自动”会让 AI 根据作品来判断。在创建或重建 X-Ray 时生效；更新时会沿用该 X-Ray 自身的类型。每本书可以在“书籍设置”中选择自己的类型，如果某本书的 X-Ray 生成了错误的类型，也可以在那里修正。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1085
#, fuzzy
msgid "Carried Entries"
msgstr "沿用条目"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1088
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In a series or project group, entries from the group's other books that have not appeared in the open book yet are carried along (in a series: from the earlier books only). They always have their own list, \"Carried from earlier books\". This sets whether they are also listed inside the X-Ray's own categories, after the book's own entries, with the book each one comes from beside it (the default), or on that list only. A group can set this for all its books in its Group Settings, and a book in Book Settings. It changes the lists only: nothing is sent and no X-Ray is rebuilt."
msgstr "在系列或项目组中,组内其他书籍中尚未在当前打开的书中出现的条目会被沿用(在系列中:仅来自较早的书)。它们始终有自己的列表\"沿用自较早的书\"。此项设置它们是否也列在 X-Ray 自身的类别中,位于本书自身条目之后,并在旁边标注其来自哪本书(默认),或仅出现在该列表中。书组可在其组设置中为其所有书籍设置,书籍可在书籍设置中设置。它只改变列表:不会发送任何内容,也不会重建任何 X-Ray。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1093
#, fuzzy
msgid "X-Ray Entry for Matching Selections"
msgstr "匹配选中内容时打开X-Ray条目"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1096
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"When a tapped word or selected text exactly matches an X-Ray entity's name or alias, open that X-Ray entry directly, skipping ahead of the dictionary and the highlight menu (including any bypass actions you have set there). Anything that doesn't match falls through to your normal dictionary/highlight behavior. Only does anything for books that have an X-Ray. A very long press at the end of a selection always shows the normal highlight menu."
msgstr "当点按的单词或选中的文本与某个 X-Ray 实体的名称或别名完全匹配时,直接打开该 X-Ray 条目,优先于词典和高亮菜单(包括您在那里设置的任何绕过操作)。不匹配的内容仍按您正常的词典/高亮行为处理。仅对有 X-Ray 的书籍有效。在选择末尾的超长按始终会显示正常的高亮菜单。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1114
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Discreetly underline words on the page that match an X-Ray entity's name or alias, as you read (dotted gray, drawn shortly after the page settles; entirely on-device). Tap a marked word to open its entry. Only active for books that have an X-Ray. EPUB page mode only."
msgstr "在你阅读时，为页面上与X-Ray实体名称或别名匹配的词语低调加下划线（灰色虚线，在页面稳定后不久绘制；完全在设备上进行）。点击标记的词语可打开其条目。仅对已有X-Ray的图书生效。仅限EPUB分页模式。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1127
#, fuzzy
msgid "Tap Marked Words to Open"
msgstr "点击标记词语以打开"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1130
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"With passive marking on, a plain tap on a marked word opens its X-Ray entry, like a link (real links in the text still win). Off = marks are visual only; a long press still opens matching entries via \"X-Ray Entry for Matching Selections\"."
msgstr "开启被动标记后，直接点击标记的词语会像链接一样打开其X-Ray条目（文本中真实的链接仍优先）。关闭=标记仅为视觉效果；长按仍可通过\"匹配选中内容时打开X-Ray条目\"打开匹配的条目。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1146
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Let marking, matching selections and entity cards recognize entities that first appear past your installed X-Ray coverage, using only the next checkpoint built past your reading position (never a later one). Identification only: such names get short-dash marks and a card that, by default, shows just the tapped name until you ask for the entry. Off = the plugin only knows entities up to your installed coverage."
msgstr "让标记、匹配选中内容和实体卡片识别首次出现在你已安装的X-Ray覆盖范围之后的实体，仅使用超出你阅读位置的下一个检查点（绝不使用更靠后的检查点）。仅限识别：此类名称会带有短横线标记，其卡片默认仅显示被点击的名称，直到你要求查看完整条目。关闭 = 插件仅了解已安装覆盖范围内的实体。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1161
#, fuzzy
msgid "Upcoming Entity Cards: %1"
msgstr "即将出现的实体卡片：%1"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1167
#, fuzzy
msgid "Name only, tap to show a one-line description"
msgstr "仅显示名称，点击后显示一行描述"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1170
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"What the card shows first for an upcoming entity, known only from the next checkpoint built ahead of you. Name only shows the tapped name and its category; a tap on the card adds the entry's first sentence, and another tap opens the full entry behind a spoiler confirmation. First sentence right away skips the first step (it can reveal that a name is another character's alias). Can be overridden per book."
msgstr "对于仅通过你前方下一个检查点得知的即将出现的实体，卡片最初显示的内容。仅名称仅显示被点击的名称及其类别；点击卡片会添加条目的第一句话，再次点击则会打开完整条目（需通过剧透确认）。立即显示第一句话会跳过第一步（这可能会透露某个名称是另一个角色的化名）。可按书籍单独设置覆盖。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1181
#, fuzzy
msgid "Card Shows: %1"
msgstr "卡片显示：%1"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1187
#, fuzzy
msgid "First sentence only"
msgstr "仅第一句话"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1190
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"How much of an entry the card shows for entities already in your installed X-Ray. First sentence keeps the card to a one-line identification, with the full entry a tap away. Full entry shows the whole description (swipe to scroll the footnote panel; the floating popup cuts it where it runs out of room). Can be overridden per book."
msgstr "卡片为已安装X-Ray中已有的实体显示多少内容。仅第一句话使卡片保持为一行式识别，完整条目可通过点击查看。完整条目显示整段描述（滑动可滚动脚注面板；浮动弹窗会在空间不足时截断内容）。可按书籍单独设置覆盖。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1195
#, fuzzy
msgid "Entity Card First"
msgstr "实体卡片优先"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1198
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Exact entity hits (tapping a marked word, or selecting text that matches an entity) open a compact card first: the name, category and role, and a one-line identification, with the full entry a tap on the card away. The identification may come from the newest built checkpoint, so newly appearing names are known on sight; the full entry stays at your reading position, behind a confirmation, while spoiler protection is on. Off = open the full entry directly."
msgstr "精确的实体命中(点按已标记的单词,或选中与实体匹配的文本)会先打开一张简洁卡片:名称、类别和角色,以及一行识别说明,轻点卡片即可查看完整条目。识别说明可能来自最新构建的检查点,因此新出现的名称一眼即可认出;在剧透保护开启时,完整条目停留在您的阅读位置,并需确认后才显示。关闭 = 直接打开完整条目。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1215
#, fuzzy
msgid "Footnote Panel"
msgstr "脚注面板"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1216
#, fuzzy
msgid "Floating Popup"
msgstr "浮动弹窗"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1218
#, fuzzy
msgid "Card Style: %1"
msgstr "卡片样式：%1"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1223
#, fuzzy
msgid "Footnote panel (bottom of the screen)"
msgstr "脚注面板（屏幕底部）"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1224
#, fuzzy
msgid "Floating popup (near the tapped word)"
msgstr "浮动弹窗（点击词语附近）"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1226
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"How the entity card is presented. The footnote panel slides in at the bottom of the screen, like KOReader's footnote popups, and follows the book's margins and font size. The floating popup is a small window anchored next to the tapped word. In both, tapping the card opens the full entry; tapping elsewhere dismisses it."
msgstr "实体卡片的呈现方式。脚注面板会从屏幕底部滑入，类似于KOReader的脚注弹窗，并遵循图书的页边距和字体大小设置。浮动弹窗是一个锚定在点击词语旁边的小窗口。两种方式中，点击卡片都会打开完整条目；点击其他位置则会关闭卡片。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1235
#, fuzzy
msgid "All Occurrences"
msgstr "所有出现"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1236
#, fuzzy
msgid "Once per Page"
msgstr "每页一次"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1237
#, fuzzy
msgid "After 10 Unseen Pages"
msgstr "未出现10页后"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1238
#, fuzzy
msgid "After 25 Unseen Pages"
msgstr "未出现25页后"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1239
#, fuzzy
msgid "First Appearance Only"
msgstr "仅首次出现"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1241
#, fuzzy
msgid "Marking Density: %1"
msgstr "标记密度：%1"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1247
#, fuzzy
msgid "Only after 10 unseen pages"
msgstr "仅未出现10页后"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1248
#, fuzzy
msgid "Only after 25 unseen pages"
msgstr "仅未出现25页后"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1252
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"How often an entity gets marked. Once per page marks its first occurrence on every page it appears. The unseen-pages options re-mark it only after it has been absent that long, so newly returning names stand out while constant companions stay quiet. First appearance marks it once in the whole book; all occurrences marks every one."
msgstr "实体被标记的频率。每页一次会在实体出现的每一页标记其首次出现。未出现页数选项仅在实体消失达到该页数后才重新标记，这样新出现的名字会更醒目，而经常出现的角色则保持安静。仅首次出现在全书中只标记一次；所有出现则标记每一处。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1269
#, fuzzy
msgid "All Entities"
msgstr "所有实体"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1270
#, fuzzy
msgid "People Only"
msgstr "仅人物"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1271
#, fuzzy
msgid "People & Places"
msgstr "人物与地点"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1273
#, fuzzy
msgid "Mark: %1"
msgstr "标记：%1"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1280
#, fuzzy
msgid "People and places"
msgstr "人物和地点"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:1282
#, fuzzy
