#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:3123
#, fuzzy
msgid "OpenRouter model: %1"
msgstr "OpenRouter 模型:%1"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:3125
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"OpenRouter draws with many makers' models through one key. GPT Image 2.5 Flare is fast and the cheapest (about half a cent at Draft); Nano Banana 2.1 is Google's everyday model; FLUX 3 (Black Forest Labs, about 5 cents), its small model FLUX 3 Klein (about a cent, and quick) and Seedream 5.0 Flash (ByteDance, about 2 cents) are other makers'; Recraft v4.1 Flash (under a cent) leans to illustration.\n"
"\n"
"More models… lists OpenRouter's whole image catalog. Shape and Detail adapt to what the picked model takes."
msgstr ""
"OpenRouter 通过一个密钥即可调用众多厂商的模型来绘图。GPT Image 2.5 Flare 速度快且最便宜(草稿档约半美分);Nano Banana 2.1 是 Google 的日常模型;FLUX 3(Black Forest Labs,约 5 美分)、其小型模型 FLUX 3 Klein(约 1 美分,速度快)和 Seedream 5.0 Flash(字节跳动,约 2 美分)来自其他厂商;Recraft v4.1 Flash(不到 1 美分)偏向插画风格。\n"
"\n"
"“更多模型……”会列出 OpenRouter 的全部图像模型目录。形状和细节会根据所选模型支持的选项自动适配。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:3134
#, fuzzy
msgid "Shape: %1"
msgstr "形状:%1"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:3136
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The picture's proportions, for every image provider.\n"
"\n"
"Fit my screen matches your screen as you hold it, so the picture fills an e-reader's page. Portrait, Landscape and Square are fixed. Let the model choose leaves it to the provider, which often draws a square or a wide picture.\n"
"\n"
"Each model gets the nearest proportions it can draw; OpenAI's 2.5 models draw your screen's own."
msgstr ""
"图片的比例,适用于所有图像提供商。\n"
"\n"
"“适合我的屏幕”会匹配你持握时的屏幕,使图片铺满电子阅读器的页面。竖版、横版和方形是固定的。“由模型决定”则交给提供商,它常常会画出方形或宽幅的图片。\n"
"\n"
"每个模型会得到它所能绘制的最接近的比例;OpenAI 的 2.5 模型会按你屏幕自身的比例绘制。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:3146
#, fuzzy
msgid "Detail: %1"
msgstr "细节:%1"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:3148
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"How much detail a picture gets, for every image provider. Draft is the fastest and cheapest; Best is the slowest and costs the most.\n"
"\n"
"OpenAI: quality low, medium or high (xhigh on the 2.5 models). xAI: grok-imagine-image-2.0 draws at low or medium quality, and Best at 2k. Gemini: Best draws at 2K, Draft and Standard at 1K, and at Draft Nano Banana 2.1 and Pro think as little as they can before drawing, which makes a picture faster.\n"
"\n"
"Grayed out while the model in use has a single setting (grok-imagine-image, Gemini Flash Lite)."
msgstr ""
"图片的细节程度,适用于所有图像提供商。草稿最快最便宜;最佳最慢,花费最高。\n"
"\n"
"OpenAI:质量为低、中或高(2.5 模型上还有超高)。xAI:grok-imagine-image-2.0 以低或中质量绘制,最佳为 2k。Gemini:最佳以 2K 绘制,草稿和标准为 1K;在草稿档下,Nano Banana 2.1 和 Pro 在绘图前会尽量少思考,从而让出图更快。\n"
"\n"
"当所用模型只有单一设置时(grok-imagine-image、Gemini Flash Lite)此项为灰色。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:3160
#, fuzzy
msgid "Write the prompt with AI"
msgstr "用 AI 撰写提示词"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:3163
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Before each picture, your chat provider's fast model writes the prompt the image model receives: from the passage, the text around it, the book's title and author, the book's Background, the X-Ray entries the passage names and your note, under rules that keep it to what the book says (and, with spoiler protection on, to nothing later than the passage).\n"
"\n"
"It adds one quick text request (a fraction of a cent) and sends that material to your chat provider (or to the provider a global Fast tier pin names) as well. The viewer's caption and the gallery say who wrote the prompt and from what.\n"
"\n"
"Off: the passage goes to the image model framed as before."
msgstr ""
"每张图之前,你的聊天提供商的快速模型会撰写图像模型收到的提示词:依据段落、其周围的文字、书名和作者、本书的背景、段落中提到的 X-Ray 条目以及你的笔记,并遵循只依据书中所述内容的规则(开启剧透保护时,不会涉及比该段落更靠后的内容)。\n"
"\n"
"这会多增加一次快速文本请求(花费不到一美分的零头),并且这些材料也会发送给你的聊天提供商(或全局快速档位指定的提供商)。查看器的说明文字和图库会注明提示词由谁撰写以及依据了什么。\n"
"\n"
"关闭:段落会像以前一样套用框架后发送给图像模型。"

