#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:3343
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"EXPERIMENTAL: for providers and models that support tool calls (Test provider shows whether yours does). Book tools let the AI search the open book's text, read specific pages, and view the table of contents, so it can ground answers in the actual book instead of guessing. Requires the book's text to be allowed (a book on Ask is asked first).\n"
"\n"
"This sets whether the Tools chip in book chats starts ON or OFF; you can always flip it per chat, and the AI still decides per question whether to actually search.\n"
"\n"
"Predefined actions are unaffected either way; they never use tools unless they explicitly offer smart retrieval. Override per book in Book Settings. Work in progress; behavior may change."
msgstr ""
"实验性功能:适用于支持工具调用的提供商和模型(“测试提供商”会显示你的是否支持)。书籍工具让 AI 可以搜索当前打开书籍的文本、阅读指定页面并查看目录,从而基于书的实际内容回答,而不是凭空猜测。需要允许使用书籍文本(设为询问的书会先询问)。\n"
"\n"
"这里设置书籍聊天中的工具标签默认开启还是关闭;你随时可以按聊天切换,而 AI 仍会针对每个问题自行决定是否真的去搜索。\n"
"\n"
"预定义操作不受影响;除非它们明确提供智能检索,否则不会使用工具。可在书籍设置中按书覆盖。仍在开发中;行为可能会变化。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:3354
#, fuzzy
msgid "Gather then answer"
msgstr "先收集再回答"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:3355
#, fuzzy
msgid "Interactive"
msgstr "交互式"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:3357
#, fuzzy
msgid "Book Tools Mode: %1"
msgstr "图书工具模式：%1"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:3359
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"How AI Book Tools answer.\n"
"\n"
"Gather then answer: the AI quietly collects passages from the book first, then answers as a normal request: the answer streams and web search stays available.\n"
"\n"
"Interactive: the original agentic loop; the AI narrates its way through lookups; no streaming or web search while tools run."
msgstr ""
"AI 图书工具如何回答。\n"
"\n"
"先收集再回答：AI 先默默从书中收集相关段落，然后像普通请求一样回答：回答会以流式输出，且网页搜索仍可使用。\n"
"\n"
"交互式：原有的智能体循环；AI 会一边查找一边讲述过程；工具运行期间无流式输出，也无法使用网页搜索。"

#: koassistant/ui/settings_schema.lua:3363
#, fuzzy
